<title>USA: Dell Computer Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Dell Computer Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ROUND ROCK, Texas 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.01		    $0.35</p>
<p> Net			188,000		   70,000</p>
<p> Net sales	    2,412,000		1,539,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 185,800		  198,700</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>			  Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.70		    $1.34</p>
<p> Net			518,000		  272,000</p>
<p> Net sales	    7,759,000		5,296,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 191,800		  194,200</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call Q4 estimate was $0.83 per share.</p>
<p>Q4 ended February 2.</p>
<p>Full name is Dell Computer Corp.  </p>
<p>Fiscal 97 results include extraordinary charge of $0.07 per share to retire a portion of the company's fiscal debt.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
